//
// Lint waivers for ioapic_deliv_merge's dependencies.
//
// arbiter_round_robin declares w_mask_decode, a per-client decode array that
// only some configurations read, so -Wall reports UNUSEDSIGNAL on it whenever
// the arbiter is instantiated. It is PRE-EXISTING in shared rtl/common and has
// nothing to do with this companion: `git diff` against that file is empty
// here, and it reports identically for every other consumer of the arbiter.
//
// It is waived rather than fixed on purpose. rtl/common is shared by the whole
// repo, and editing a shared primitive to quiet one consumer's lint is how a
// working design gets broken for everyone else -- twice already in this repo's
// history. If it is worth fixing it is worth fixing for the family, in its own
// change, with the family re-linted.
//
// Scoped by BOTH rule and file so it cannot mask a future UNUSEDSIGNAL in this
// companion's own RTL.
lint_off -rule UNUSEDSIGNAL -file "*/rtl/common/arbiter_round_robin.sv"
